Refine Employee Analytics Dashboard UI and User Experience

1. Introduction

   Following the implementation of the core Employee Analytics features, the final phase focused on refining the dashboard's user interface and overall user experience. The objective was to improve the visual consistency, usability, responsiveness, and navigation across the Employee Analytics module, ensuring a modern and intuitive interface for managers and administrators.

   This refinement phase emphasized improving the overall look and feel of the dashboard without altering the core functionality.

2. Objective

   The primary objective of this implementation was to enhance the overall user experience by refining the dashboard layout, improving visual consistency, and optimizing interface components for better usability and accessibility.

3. Dashboard Layout Refinement

   The dashboard layout was reviewed and optimized to improve content organization and readability.

   Implemented
